WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Your product deserves a great story.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Our example is Idle Fantasy Shop, a cozy little crafting game.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Its real patch is our starting point. Choose what shipped, and leave internal notes out.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
A devlog for the details. A community post for your players. The same facts, a different fit.

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Choose a voice: warm, clear, or lively. Local Gemma writes each version, with sources to review.

6
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Need something shorter? Keep your call to action and a suggested tag, within two hundred and eighty characters.

7
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Switch between your drafts. Your edits stay with each format, right here in this tab.

8
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Check the details, remove a tag, and take the Markdown with you.

9
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.000
PatchPitch. Your product deserves a great story.
